{1030}{}{PC Slave}
{2000}{}{The wooden house creaks as the robed man turns to face you. He lowers his hood, revealing a wrinkled, bearded face, then licks his dry lips.

You’ve already taken everything from us...}
{2010}{}{Who are you?}
{2020}{}{We need more.}
{2030}{}{We need slaves.}
{2040}{}{We fixed your son.}
{2050}{}{Nothing.}
{3000}{}{Hmm... my people and I still have guns. We’re not giving up our freedom that easily.}
{3010}{}{Let's see about that.}
{3020}{}{I saw your son...}
{4000}{}{Yeah... he’s been tied up for days, ever since he started going mad. I’m afraid he’s turning into a ghoul.}
{4010}{}{We can save him.}
{5000}{}{Lies! He can't be saved, he's possessed by the devil himself now.}
{5010}{}{Reverse ghouilification? EASY.}
{6000}{}{The man strokes his beard and gazes out of the window.

I’ll go with you and convince my people to come along, but my son stays here. That is, if you can really do what you claim.}
{6010}{}{Deal.}
{6020}{}{Nah, it's just easier to take you by force.}
{7000}{}{I’m Lenny. We settled here a couple of years ago and have been making a living by scavenging. We’ve been paying our cut to you Centrals ever since.}
{7010}{}{Time to pay again.}
{7020}{}{Centrals?}
{8000}{}{The wooden house creaks as the robed man turns to face you. He lowers his hood, revealing a wrinkled, bearded face, then licks his dry lips.

Who are you?
}
{8010}{}{I need shelter.}
{9000}{}{Well I be damned. I talked to my son and he's lucid. You've made something impossible.
}
{9010}{}{Let's get back to our deal.}
{10000}{}{The deal? Well, I thought about it and I'll let you take some people. I told Jason and his people that you guys gonna take them back to trade. The rest is on you...}
{10010}{}{Sending your people? You said you gonna walk yourself.}
{11000}{}{I can't go! Look, I just got my son back. I need time to reconnect with him.}
{11010}{}{Alright, then we need more materials.}
{12000}{}{The man shakes his head and spreads his arms.

This is insane. I can sell you some scrap, but we paid your people their cut recently.}
{12010}{}{Alright, give it up then.}
{13000}{}{He sighs and pulls a box filled with scrap from beneath the table.
All right, fine. That’s all we’ve got for now.}
{13010}{}{Good.}
{14000}{}{Yeah, you people from Rado and Dog Town. Slavers, mercenaries and "businessmen".}
{14010}{}{Yes, that's us.}
{15000}{}{Look, if you escaped Rado, I'd rather you stay away from here. We have enough problems with you Centrals.}
{15010}{}{Cowards.}
{16000}{}{My son is dead. I'm done talking to you.}

